  "description": "<p data-start=\"118\" data-end=\"184\">🎧 <strong data-start=\"121\" data-end=\"182\">KRK VXT4 Studio Monitoren Set (2 stuks) | ZGAN | € 319,99</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"186\" data-end=\"424\">Op zoek naar hoogwaardige studiomonitors voor professioneel gebruik of DJ-setup? Deze <strong data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"288\">KRK VXT4 set</strong> levert een uitzonderlijk helder en gebalanceerd geluid, ideaal voor mixen, masteren of gewoon genieten van muziek op studiokwaliteit.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"449\">🔊 <strong data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"447\">Specificaties:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"742\">\r\n<li data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"480\">\r\n<p data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"480\"><strong data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"469\">Merk & model:</strong> KRK VXT4</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"510\">\r\n<p data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"510\"><strong data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"491\">Set:</strong> 2 stuks (stereo)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"560\">\r\n<p data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"560\"><strong data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"526\">Vermogen:</strong> 45W (LF) + 15W (HF) per speaker</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"599\">\r\n<p data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"599\"><strong data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"584\">Frequentiebereik:</strong> 56Hz – 22kHz</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"632\">\r\n<p data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"632\"><strong data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"613\">Inputs:</strong> XLR / 6.3mm Jack</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"672\">\r\n<p data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"672\"><strong data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"647\">Gebruik:</strong> Studio, DJ, multimedia</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"712\">\r\n<p data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"712\"><strong data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"685\">Staat:</strong> Zo goed als nieuw (ZGAN)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"742\">\r\n<p data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"742\"><strong data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"729\">Inclusief:</strong> Netsnoeren</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"854\">✅ Professionele geluidskwaliteit<br data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"779\">✅ Compact formaat met krachtig geluid<br data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"819\">✅ Volledig getest en 100% werkend</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"859\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"993\">📍 <strong data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"893\">Used Products Spijkenisse</strong><br data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"896\">Nieuwstraat 16, 3201 EA Spijkenisse<br data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"934\">💬 Dé plek om je spullen te kopen, verkopen en verpanden!</p>",
